# Gate step 1647-fb52 — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# WHAT IT GUARDS. 793-a8e7 S3: on the WSL2 Vulkan opt-in lane the inference
# container pins models below the decode floor all-CPU (num_gpu 0), and on any
# other tier it restores every pin it recorded, leaving no residue after an
# opt-out (coordinator condition 2026-10-12). The subject is
# images/inference/decode-floor-pin.sh, sourced by the entrypoint.
#
# The step RUNS that script, unchanged, against a stub `ollama` keeping a model
# store on disk: pins and the record on gpu-vulkan, idempotence, the opt-out arm
# (no residual num_gpu 0, record removed, the operator's own num_gpu kept), a
# lower measured floor restoring, floor `all`, and a junk floor falling back to
# the labelled provisional 3. Pre-fix: no such script; sabotages (opt-out skips
# the restore, pinning over an operator num_gpu) each turn it red.
#
# STEP_LUA is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
